        "original_id": "45bb916c-f2b3-5db6-86ff-b02d625f4f5b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ghana Club 100, Ghana Investment Promotion Centre, Government of Ghana, Ghana Chamber of Mines, Ghana National Petroleum Corporation\n- Places: Ghana\n- Concepts: top company rankings, investment promotion\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, the Ghana Investment Promotion Centre first compiled the Ghana Club 100.\n- The Ghana Club 100 is a yearly official list of the top 100 companies in Ghana.\n- The Ghana Investment Promotion Centre created the Ghana Club 100 to recognize top companies in Ghana and encourage competition and improvement of company products and services.\n- The Ghana Investment Promotion Centre is a Government of Ghana agency that encourages, promotes, and facilitates investments in all sectors of Ghana's economy except mining and petroleum.\n- The Ghana Chamber of Mines handles mining investments in Ghana.\n- The Ghana National Petroleum Corporation handles petroleum investments in Ghana.",
